WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:06.080
There was a time long ago...

00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:12.440
...when women ruled with unparalleled power,

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:16.760
as warriors, queens, mothers of nations.

00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:22.480
And there was
none among them more iconic

00:00:23.240 --> 00:00:24.440
than Cleopatra.

00:00:24.520 --> 00:00:26.240
I would die for Egypt.

00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:27.840
What would you die for?

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.640
I am Isis. I am a god.

00:00:30.720 --> 00:00:34.240
As long as she's alive,
she is the pharaoh.

00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:36.840
My father's will
names me coruler of Egypt.

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:40.960
Julius Caesar
is aware that Cleopatra

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:44.120
is one of the best educated women
in the Mediterranean.

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:47.160
He wants to be king
to Cleopatra's queen.

00:00:47.240 --> 00:00:48.840
There is no future without the past.

00:00:50.360 --> 00:00:52.920
She was using these relationships
with Mark Antony

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:55.080
to protect herself and her country.

00:00:55.160 --> 00:00:57.760
There is no Rome without Egypt.

00:00:59.040 --> 00:01:02.880
Cleopatra was trying
to save the country that she loved

00:01:02.960 --> 00:01:04.680
from destruction.

00:01:06.600 --> 00:01:10.000
I did what I had to do
to protect what is mine!

00:01:10.600 --> 00:01:12.840
This is a woman exercising power.

00:01:15.840 --> 00:01:17.960
Cleopatra was a Ptolemaic ruler.

00:01:18.040 --> 00:01:21.360
The very first Ptolemy
is a general of Alexander the Great.

00:01:21.440 --> 00:01:23.120
It's possible that she was an Egyptian.

00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:25.280
I imagine her
to have curly hair like me

00:01:25.360 --> 00:01:26.280
and similar skin color.

00:01:26.360 --> 00:01:29.280
I remember
my grandmother saying to me,

00:01:29.360 --> 00:01:31.440
"I don't care
what they tell you in school,

00:01:31.520 --> 00:01:33.200
Cleopatra was Black."

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:35.800
She has become an icon.

00:01:35.880 --> 00:01:37.040
I'm a god.

00:01:37.960 --> 00:01:39.640
Queen of Kings!

00:01:39.720 --> 00:01:43.200
Her story resonates
with every woman.

